{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/juryback0000.png?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Episode 3 of our captivating visual novel arrives as a two-part experience, included in a single DLC package. Both parts are accessible with your purchase, and the second part will be seamlessly added to this package upon release at no additional cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/brooke_image0000.png?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Knives &amp; Dark Desires,&quot; step back into the jury dock, unravel deeper mysteries, and reconnect with beloved characters in an immersive narrative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/enhanced0000.png?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Episode 3 elevates the visual experience with refined animations, featuring improved quality and innovative liquid effects. These enhancements deliver the most realistic and visually stunning scenes to date, immersing players in every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/ep3storegif.gif?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/newlove0000.png?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This chapter introduces opportunities to forge meaningful relationships with two new characters. The first is a familiar face, previously glimpsed from a distance\u2014perhaps even in a fleeting, daring moment. Now, players can start to engage with her directly, potentially sparking a passionate romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/megan.png?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The second is the enigmatic 12th Juror, arriving fashionably late to the story. Her unique presence adds an exciting layer to the narrative, with surprises best discovered through gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/newsoundimagenew0000.png?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Episode 3 enhances the auditory experience with diverse, high-quality sound effects. In collaboration with talented vocal artists, we\u2019ve crafted richer, more dynamic audio to bring the characters\u2019 emotions and interactions to life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734730?t=1749677534","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734730?t=1749677534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/ae3794253d4c8d52531d067eaad4098f4b1d7082/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749677534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/ae3794253d4c8d52531d067eaad4098f4b1d7082/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749677534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This episode contains intimate sex scenes between men and women, and women with women. There are references to drugs, as well as scenes containing drug abuse. This episode also contains a few images of gore."},"detailed_description":"<p clas