parking a passionate romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/megan.png?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The second is the enigmatic 12th Juror, arriving fashionably late to the story. Her unique presence adds an exciting layer to the narrative, with surprises best discovered through gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/extras/newsoundimagenew0000.png?t=1749677534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Episode 3 enhances the auditory experience with diverse, high-quality sound effects. In collaboration with talented vocal artists, we\u2019ve crafted richer, more dynamic audio to bring the characters\u2019 emotions and interactions to life.</p>","developers":["Nickle3DArt"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2258290","name":"Jury - Episode 1: Before the Trial"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734730/fb8fb48071120f3c54790c2826fe66b99c836a1d/header.jpg?t=1749677534","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145626,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145626/movie480.mp4?t=1749677532","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145626/movie_max.mp4?t=1749677532"},"name":"Episode 3 Part 1 - Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145626/c4358950d80b4ff92b62c1452c52e22071452ad7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749677532","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145626/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749677532","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145626/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749677532"}}],"name"